                   RecipeIngredient(amount: "3 tbsp", item: "sesame seeds"),
                   RecipeIngredient(amount: "3", item: "dried red chiles"),
                   RecipeIngredient(amount: "1/2 tsp", item: "sichuan peppercorns (stand-in for timur)"),
               ],
               steps: [
                   "Mix the beef with onion, cilantro, ginger, garlic, a teaspoon of salt, and a tablespoon of oil, stirring in one direction just until combined; overworking makes the filling dense.",
                   "For the achar, char the whole tomatoes under the broiler until blistered and collapsing, about ten minutes, while you toast the sesame seeds and chiles in a dry pan.",
                   "Blend the tomatoes, sesame, chiles, Sichuan peppercorns, remaining salt, and remaining oil into a smooth, pourable orange sauce, and taste; it should tingle and bite.",
                   "Hold a wrapper flat, place a heaped teaspoon of filling in the center, and moisten the rim with a wet finger.",
                   "Pleat around the edge, gathering fold after fold toward the center and twisting the top shut, or simply fold into half-moons and crimp; sealed matters more than pretty.",
                   "Set the momos on an oiled steamer rack without touching, and steam over hard-boiling water 10 to 12 minutes until the skins turn glossy and slightly translucent.",
                   "Serve ten to a plate straight from the steamer, with achar for dunking, and warn people about the hot juice inside the first bite.",
